---Creates an upload repository or reserves an asynchronous deployed Worker import by name. Worker imports require Idempotency-Key. Push upload source to `main` or specify the `branch` to scan in the scan request.
---
---`POST /accounts/{account_id}/managed-defense/vulnerability-discovery/repos`
---@param input cloudflare.managed_defense.CreateVulnerabilityDiscoveryRepositoryRequest
---@return cloudflare.managed_defense.CreateVulnerabilityDiscoveryRepositoryResult? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_vulnerability_discovery_repository(input) end

---Submits repository intent for operator review. This endpoint does not immediately start execution. Worker-imported repositories must be ready; explicit repository host scopes must be authorized and explicit branch selections must exist before the request is persisted.
---
---`POST /accounts/{account_id}/managed-defense/vulnerability-discovery/scans`
---@param input cloudflare.managed_defense.CreateVulnerabilityDiscoveryScanRequest
---@return cloudflare.managed_defense.CreateVulnerabilityDiscoveryScanResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_vulnerability_discovery_scan(input) end

---Gets the repository projection of the active operator-reviewed scan report. `scan_id` is the customer scan's stable request ID.
---
---`GET /accounts/{account_id}/managed-defense/vulnerability-discovery/repos/{repo_id}/scans/{scan_id}/report`
---@param input cloudflare.managed_defense.GetVulnerabilityDiscoveryReportRequest
---@return cloudflare.managed_defense.GetVulnerabilityDiscoveryReportResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_vulnerability_discovery_report(input) end

---Gets repository metadata, source readiness, and customer scan history.
---
---`GET /accounts/{account_id}/managed-defense/vulnerability-discovery/repos/{repo_id}`
---@param input cloudflare.managed_defense.GetVulnerabilityDiscoveryRepositoryRequest
---@return cloudflare.managed_defense.GetVulnerabilityDiscoveryRepositoryResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_vulnerability_discovery_repository(input) end

---Gets one customer-requested scan across its review and execution lifecycle.
---
---`GET /accounts/{account_id}/managed-defense/vulnerability-discovery/scans/{scan_id}`
---@param input cloudflare.managed_defense.GetVulnerabilityDiscoveryScanRequest
---@return cloudflare.managed_defense.GetVulnerabilityDiscoveryScanResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_vulnerability_discovery_scan(input) end

